    "summary": "Pendant mask; regalia; carved from ivory. In form of naturalistic human face. Hairstyle carved in low relief; head crowned with circlet of European heads inlaid with copper alloy. Decorative pierced lattice-work ruff below chin inlaid with copper alloy; series of suspension loops around outside. Two vertical bars incised into forehead inlaid with iron. Four scarification marks carved above each eye. Iron inlay around eyes; pupils inlaid wth iron. Two suspension loops on each side of face.",
